{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "For Talent Seek: Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports."
      ],
      "justification": "Opening unit implicitly starts the process and describes the initial check action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "At the same time, you should continue to monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Monitoring condition modeled as an action step preserves the intended behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have been completed"
      ],
      "justification": "Positive arm of the first decision point; logic and threshold correctly captured."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have been completed, you can proceed with the process"
      ],
      "justification": "Positive arm of the first decision point; logic and threshold correctly captured."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "if they have not been completed"
      ],
      "justification": "Negative arm of the first decision point."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "if they have not been completed, you should flag it and send a reminder"
      ],
      "justification": "Negative arm of the first decision point."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "check again if the Referee Reports have been completed"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct restatement of the re-check step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have",
        "If they have, you can continue with the process"
      ],
      "justification": "Positive outcome of the re-check; condition modeled as an action/branch preserves flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have",
        "If they have, you can continue with the process"
      ],
      "justification": "Positive outcome of the re-check; condition modeled as an action/branch preserves flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have",
        "If they have, you can continue with the process"
      ],
      "justification": "Positive outcome of the re-check; condition modeled as an action/branch preserves flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not"
      ],
      "justification": "Negative outcome of the re-check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you should flag it again and send another reminder"
      ],
      "justification": "Negative outcome of the re-check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "move on to organizing interviews for the Selection Panel with the top candidates"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of the next process step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "receive feedback from the interview candidates"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, you need to check if a Psychometric Test is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of the conditional check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is"
      ],
      "justification": "Positive arm of the psychometric test decision leading to the nested HR check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, you should then check if an HR Specialist is required"
      ],
      "justification": "Positive arm of the psychometric test decision leading to the nested HR check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->c3",
        "action:n18"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you can continue with the process and coordinate the second round of selection"
      ],
      "justification": "Negative arm bypasses the HR check and proceeds directly to coordinating the second round."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b5->n17"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If an HR Specialist is required"
      ],
      "justification": "Nested positive branch handling the HR specialist requirement."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n17"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If an HR Specialist is required, you should schedule the test with a third party"
      ],
      "justification": "Nested positive branch handling the HR specialist requirement."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b5->c3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise"
      ],
      "justification": "Nested negative branch when an HR specialist is not required."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n19"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise, you can proceed to complete the Psychometric Test"
      ],
      "justification": "Nested negative branch when an HR specialist is not required."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n20"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of the final actionable step."
    }
  ],
